name: "cryon"

displayName: "Cryon"

author: "bowen-H0"

description: '''
[#7ec8e3]Cryon[] adds a brand new frozen planet to the game.

You can carry resources to other sectors, just like in [accent]Serpulo[].

Over [accent]100+[] new pieces of content! Including new ores, new machines, and new units.

Current development progress: [accent]T1 ~ T3 tech[] is complete. The campaign is currently being tested.

[accent]Thanks for playing this mod!
Feel free to report issues or suggest ideas: [lightgray]github bowen-H0[]

Supported languages: [cyan]English[] / [cyan]中文[]

Your mod browser will usually handle dependencies automatically.
Please install Cryon Core first! This is a dependency package!

This mod is currently in testing.
'''
version: "13.0.0"

minGameVersion: "146"


